S5 规模与池子取小的判据反了（池大时抽不满）	aplus/backtest.py
    return rng.sample(list(all_codes), min(sample_size, len(all_codes)))
=== 变异体 ===
    return rng.sample(list(all_codes), max(sample_size, len(all_codes)))

